<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2026710205/181022+qantas-header-brand-680x70.png" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Hi xxx,</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">As a valued Qantas corporate customer, we understand the importance of your business travel needs and wanted to reach out to provide you with an update on your Account Manager.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Xxx has been successful in securing a new role and their last day as your Account Manager will be xx/xx/2019.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Please be assured that a comprehensive handover will take place prior to this date, to ensure a smooth transition between now and when we introduce you to a new Account Manager.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">In the interim, please do not hesitate to contact us on 13 10 85 to get in touch with one of our experienced team members. We're here to help any time between 8.30am to 5.30pm AEDT/AEST Monday to Friday.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Kind regards,<br>The Qantas Corporate Sales Team</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="font-size: 10px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
